{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"mondstadt_overview","name_zh":"蒙德","name_en":"Mondstadt","aliases":["蒙德","Mondstadt"],"category":"nation","scope":"regional","regions":["Mondstadt"],"summary":"蒙德（Mondstadt）是提瓦特东北部的七国之一，也是提瓦特的主要地区之一。其元素为风，理念为自由，敬奉风之神巴巴托斯；主要城市为蒙德城，管理实体为西风骑士团。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"mondstadt_overview_fact_001","text":"蒙德是提瓦特七国之一，也是提瓦特的主要地区之一。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前概况","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_mondstadt_overview"]},{"fact_id":"mondstadt_overview_fact_002","text":"蒙德位于提瓦特东北部。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前地理格局","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_mondstadt_overview"]},{"fact_id":"mondstadt_overview_fact_003","text":"蒙德对应的元素为风，奉行的理念为自由。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前国家概况","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_mondstadt_overview","bwiki_mondstadt_overview"]},{"fact_id":"mondstadt_overview_fact_004","text":"蒙德敬奉风之神巴巴托斯（Barbatos）；巴巴托斯是风之神与自由之神。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前国家信仰","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_mondstadt_overview","bwiki_mondstadt_overview"]},{"fact_id":"mondstadt_overview_fact_005","text":"蒙德的主要城市是蒙德城（Mondstadt City）。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前国家概况","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_mondstadt_overview","bwiki_mondstadt_overview"]},{"fact_id":"mondstadt_overview_fact_006","text":"蒙德的管理实体为西风骑士团（Knights of Favonius）。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前治理状况","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_mondstadt_overview","bwiki_mondstadt_overview"]},{"fact_id":"mondstadt_overview_fact_007","text":"Fandom资料页列出的蒙德节庆包括 Windblume Festival、Ludi Harpastum 与 Weinlesefest。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前文化概况","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_mondstadt_overview"]},{"fact_id":"mondstadt_overview_fact_008","text":"Fandom资料页列出的蒙德区域包括 Brightcrown Mountains、Dragonspine、Galesong Hill、Starfell Valley、Windrest Peak 与 Windwail Highland。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前区域划分","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_mondstadt_overview"]}],"timeline":[],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"蒙德作为提瓦特七国之一，其大致方位、自由理念、风神信仰、主要城市以及由西风骑士团管理等基本概况属于公开可见的国家信息。","likely_known_by":["蒙德居民","到访蒙德的旅人","了解提瓦特七国基本概况者"],"unlikely_known_by":[],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":[]},"activation_keys":["蒙德","Mondstadt"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["旅行者开始寻找失散血亲的剧情定位、魔神任务章节信息及区域解锁条件","可操作角色、相关角色与NPC名单","严寒值、生命值损失、状态积累速度及其减缓方式","攻击附魔、伤害属性和环境物件的战斗交互","收集物、供奉系统、奖励兑换、任务步骤、合成与掉落机制","玩家操控飞行形态等交互说明","原声音乐列表"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["BWiki编年史中未获Fandom主要来源支持的古代史、贵族史、灾厄史及后续事件未写入本卡","BWiki中以“推测”“可能”“疑似”等形式提出的编辑者推论及因果解释未写入本卡","Fandom摘录的描述同时使用“city”指称蒙德并叙述湖中岛屿上的城市；为避免混淆国家与蒙德城，未将该段作为蒙德国土整体的地理事实"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_mondstadt_overview","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Mondstadt","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Mondstadt","language":"en","revision_id":"2124390","source_text_sha256":"f2000869adb27e351f0bea8547e451584998abaa0806cef0056c9dab45964946"},{"source_id":"bwiki_mondstadt_overview","provider":"bwiki","role":"cross_language_verification","title":"蒙德","url":"https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/%E8%92%99%E5%BE%B7","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"673150","source_text_sha256":"a0719fec105fd4418ede13150f9a9fdd0dc66b3f29054626c9c78915ecdbf900"}],"evidence_bundle_sha256":"c21d6faef743545699bd81bc188a02f1594ed65bd70608bfce41244e2f79946b","review":{"cross_language_conflicts":[],"uncertain_claims":["Fandom页面的引述描述将蒙德称为“city”，但页面正文和目标定义均将其作为国家与地区；本卡按目标定义处理，并避免把蒙德城的岛屿位置扩展为全国地理事实。"],"missing_evidence":["Fandom主要来源未提供足以支持蒙德历史沿革时间线的正文证据；依来源政策，不能使用BWiki单独建立timeline。"],"needs_human_review":false}}